WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

This licence covers the Fugaro Enterprise Edition: every file under the ee/ directory of the
Fugaro repository, in source form and in every compiled form built from it, including ee/ code
compiled into a released binary (the "Software").

Nothing under ee/ has ever been released: the directory held no code before this licence was
added to it, and no release has carried ee/ code. The rest of the repository outside ee/,
console/ and mobile/ stays under the MIT licence in the repository's root LICENSE, and this
licence takes nothing away from it.

